{"id":"51c43e0240787ebb","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-provable.md","title":"Provable","display":"df-provable — Provable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-provable","aliases":["92-df-provable"],"display":"df-provable — Provable","depends_on":["[[92-df-formal-system]]","[[92-df-proof]]"],"source":"第 III 章 p. 30（PDF 47）","source_status":"原书可证性概念的本地实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable — Provable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"23b675b1348a813e\" href=\"?note=23b675b1348a813e\" title=\"92-df-proof\">92-df-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 p. 30（PDF 47）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书可证性概念的本地实现"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-provable-—-Provable-$\\vdash$\">df-provable — Provable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}=(\\Sigma,A,R)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}=(\\Sigma,A,R)\\)</span> (formal system, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (candidate conclusion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}\\)</span> (proof relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"23b675b1348a813e\" href=\"?note=23b675b1348a813e\" title=\"92-df-proof\">92-df-proof</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable} \\vdash \\mathcal{F}\\vdash\\varphi \\leftrightarrow \\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}(\\pi,\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable} \\vdash \\mathcal{F}\\vdash\\varphi \\leftrightarrow \\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}(\\pi,\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> : 可证关系</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F} \\vdash \\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal{F} \\vdash \\varphi\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>中可证</li>\n<li>可证性由存在证明序列定义</li>\n<li>这是由有限证明序列定义的句法/证明论概念，不是模型论满足关系</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>可证性是存在以该公式结尾的有限证明。它与原书编码谓词 PE/PA 一致的前提，是使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7a63648901cbcd33\" href=\"?note=7a63648901cbcd33\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-proof-code\">92-df-smullyan-proof-code</a> 的原书编码，不是把 G 的公式码直接拿来。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-provable-—-Provable-$\\vdash$","text":"df-provable — Provable $\\vdash$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"23b675b1348a813e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{F}=(\\Sigma,A,R)$ (formal system, see [[92-df-formal-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"23b675b1348a813e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}$ (proof relation, see [[92-df-proof]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-proof-code","status":"resolved","id":"7a63648901cbcd33","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"可证性是存在以该公式结尾的有限证明。它与原书编码谓词 PE/PA 一致的前提，是使用 [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] 的原书编码，不是把 G 的公式码直接拿来。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}=(\\Sigma,A,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable} \\vdash \\mathcal{F}\\vdash\\varphi \\leftrightarrow \\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal F}(\\pi,\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F} \\vdash \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false}],"bytes":1185,"backlinks":[{"id":"6fc24b4011f16912","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\vdash\\varphi$ (metatheoretic provability relation, see [[92-df-provable]])"},{"id":"c04baacf4202d9f7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ 与 $\\vdash$ 分别见[[92-df-sentence]]、[[92-df-provable]]。"},{"id":"fceaada2b896f5e2","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · dep